<title>FRANCE: Valeo sees higher 1997 H1 results.</title>
<headline>Valeo sees higher 1997 H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>French car parts manufacturer Valeo said on Thursday it expected to show higher first-half results.</p>
<p>&quot;The group will publish its half-year accounts in July. They should show an increase in activity, results, employment and investments both in France and internationally,&quot; it said in its first-half sales statement.</p>
<p>First-half sales rose 14.6 percent to 17.26 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
